안함사장학금은 청년들의 꿈을\n응원하기 위해 시민들이 자발적으로 모여 만든 장학금으로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">벌써</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> 3</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">회\n째를 맞이하고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">꿈수저 장학금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">기휘위기 장학금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">문화예술 장학금</span></span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">공익소셜 장학금 등의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">가지 장학금을 운영하고 있으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">장학생 수여식을 매회 국회에서 열고\n있습니다.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">청년들의 삶이 장학금을 받은 이후에도</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">실질적으로\n변화될 수 있도록</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">청년 정책개선 활동</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">멘토링 활동을 통해서\n도움을 주고 노력하고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0cm; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">◇ 선발대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0cm; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">만</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">18</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">세</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">~34</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">세 청년이라면 누구나 지원가능</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;\">◇</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">지원분야</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0cm; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">꿈수저 장학생 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">경제적으로 어려움을 겪고 있으나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">꿈을 위해 계속 노력중인 학생</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">문화예술 장학생 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">문화예술 분야에서 활동하는 청년</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">기후위기 장학생 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">기후위기 관련 활동을 하고있는 청년</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">공익소셜 장학생 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">사회공동체 기여를 위한 활동을 하고 있는 청년</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color: black; border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: red; border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">국적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">출신학교에 제한 없음</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color: black; border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: red; border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">장학금 사용 증빙 필요없음</span><sp